      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To make Elias's feeling feel real, focus less on the grand gesture and more on the mundane things that seem unbearable. Detail small actions—the weight of a coffee cup, the dullness of traffic noise—as anchors for his despair. Show how his internal void colors every sensory detail, making the world feel less vibrant and more gray. This subtle grounding can make the intense emotion feel tangible to the reader.",
