      "content": "It is absolutely not weird to write dark material; many powerful narratives explore profound sorrow and emptiness. Good writing doesn't require a neat, happy resolution; sometimes, the most honest and impactful portrayals exist in the difficult, ambiguous moments. Letting the darkness remain can be an incredibly powerful commentary on the human condition, offering a mirror to difficult truths.",
